    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm trying to write a mission statement for a new local org i'm starting up. it's called \"the legacy project\" and our main goal is basically to protect and preserve our country's traditional cultural heritage and local customs from being lost or diluted. can you help me draft a professional-sounding mission statement for us?",
